{"mode":"words","text":"Hore vidíš text presne tak, ako ti ho aplikácia zobrazuje. Každé slovo je malá kartička: hore je slovo v cieľovom jazyku, pod ním jeho význam v tvojom materinskom jazyku — slovo za slovom, v poradí podľa cieľového jazyka. Pod tým je ešte raz plynulý preklad celej vety. V prípade jazykov s iným písmom sa zobrazí riadok s prepisom, aby si mohol všetko prečítať. Ťukni na slovo: hlasové prehrávanie pokračuje presne od tohto miesta.","words":[{"s":0,"e":302},{"s":348,"e":639},{"s":708,"e":952},{"s":1010,"e":1347},{"s":1405,"e":1741},{"s":1823,"e":2067},{"s":2125,"e":2206},{"s":2264,"e":2334},{"s":2403,"e":3019},{"s":3065,"e":3808},{"s":4412,"e":4783},{"s":4841,"e":5248},{"s":5364,"e":5457},{"s":5526,"e":5759},{"s":5840,"e":6571},{"s":7175,"e":7442},{"s":7477,"e":7535},{"s":7593,"e":7930},{"s":7964,"e":7999},{"s":8057,"e":8464},{"s":8545,"e":9195},{"s":9369,"e":9567},{"s":9613,"e":9787},{"s":9857,"e":10066},{"s":10112,"e":10553},{"s":10577,"e":10612},{"s":10670,"e":10972},{"s":11088,"e":11726},{"s":11808,"e":12272},{"s":12353,"e":12458},{"s":12841,"e":13212},{"s":13271,"e":13363},{"s":13421,"e":14072},{"s":14281,"e":14350},{"s":14397,"e":14838},{"s":14908,"e":15163},{"s":15221,"e":15755},{"s":15801,"e":16382},{"s":17195,"e":17415},{"s":17450,"e":17636},{"s":17729,"e":17775},{"s":17833,"e":18089},{"s":18135,"e":18298},{"s":18379,"e":18762},{"s":18820,"e":19226},{"s":19250,"e":19528},{"s":19575,"e":20028},{"s":20840,"e":20910},{"s":20968,"e":21386},{"s":21467,"e":21955},{"s":21978,"e":22001},{"s":22082,"e":22315},{"s":22373,"e":22802},{"s":22872,"e":22942},{"s":22988,"e":23441},{"s":23476,"e":23778},{"s":23824,"e":23847},{"s":23905,"e":24521},{"s":24555,"e":24788},{"s":24834,"e":24915},{"s":24973,"e":25206},{"s":25229,"e":25589},{"s":25635,"e":26343},{"s":27040,"e":27319},{"s":27388,"e":27481},{"s":27539,"e":28073},{"s":28886,"e":29292},{"s":29362,"e":30070},{"s":30140,"e":30720},{"s":30778,"e":31150},{"s":31220,"e":31312},{"s":31336,"e":31614},{"s":